				<wikidot:authorName>toadking07</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1632267</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The idea of a stone that causes you to procrastinate being released into the world is scary enough without it being reproduced! Just the natural grinding of the stone to create smaller stones and grains of sand, sand with the same properties, spreading out, getting blown across a city, being mixed into structures, being absorbed into the human body! We really could be doomed if something like that became widespread and strategically placed.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
